blocks.en:
12 cases of Cell-based vs. Organism-based ;
6 cases of Biochemical vs. Cell-based ;
3 cases of Tissue-based vs. Cell-based ;
remaining cases including small-molecule physicochemical (BARD) vs. Biochemical (ChEMBL).
Together, these observations show that even highly manual, expert-driven curation does not guarantee consistency, either within a single record or across sources.

blocks.zh:
12起基于Cell vs. 以生物为主;
6例生化诉. 基于细胞的;
3起基于组织的案件。 基于细胞的;
其余病例,包括小分子物理化学(BARD)对生化(CHEMBL).
这些意见加在一起表明,即使是高度手工的、专家驱动的校准也不能保证一致性,无论是在单一记录内还是在不同来源之间。
